:name: Blue Pill HAL demo - GDB
:description: 调试用:加载平台与固件后开 GDB Server(3333),停在 Monitor 等连接。用法见教程 00-env-setup 调试篇

using sysbus
mach create
$plf?=$ORIGIN/../../stm32-tutorials/f103/0_blink/platform/blue_pill.repl
machine LoadPlatformDescription $plf

$bin?=$ORIGIN/build/stm32_demo.elf

sysbus LoadELF $bin

machine StartGdbServer 3333
